      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そんな人の話なんか聞くに値しないわ。\r\nここで散りなさい。",
        "official_en": "...I’ll not waste my time listening to someone so pathetic. We’re done here.",
        "real_en": "I have no reason to listen to someone like you. Die here."
