      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なんのために、か。\r\nその質問に答えるのは難しいな……。",
        "official_en": "That’s...a tough question. It’s complicated. I couldn’t—",
        "real_en": "What am I fighting for...? That's a hard question to answer..."
